# Mama Mia (outlands): Mamaulabion in Norg (call-only: scripts/zones/Norg/npcs/Mamaulabion.lua; no default, so no
# alternation). Norg fame level 4, The Moonlit Path not completed: the script's else, 93. The Moonlit Path completed (a
# GM) at fame level 3: 93. A trade while available: nothing. Level 4: 191, finished: begun. Accepted, none given: 192.
# The Bubbly Water: its bit set in the trade, 193 (1202), finished: confirmed (taken); again: 194 (1202; no finish: kept).
# Two items at once: nothing (no single tradeHasExactly). Egil's Torch, the Eye of Nept, the Desert Light, the Elder
# Branch, the Rust B Gone: 193 each (confirmed). The Ancient's Key: all seven: 195, finished: confirmed, MamaMia_date =
# JstMidnight(). Before the date: 196. GetSystemTime() is 1800000000 in the harness: MamaMia_date one past it (a GM):
# 196; at it: 197 (not before the date); the inventory full: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED (14625); with room: the Evoker's
# Ring, ITEM_OBTAINED, fame +40, completed, tradesMamaMia 0. Completed with the ring: 198; a trade: nothing.
char zone=Norg pos=-55.9,-9.4,68.7 job=SMN lvl=75
fame Norg 225
item BottleOfBubblyWater
item BottleOfBubblyWater
item EgilsTorch
item EyeOfNept
item DoseOfDesertLight
item ElderBranch
item BottleOfRustBGone
item AncientsKey
login
