finish
quest Windurst.TheMoonlitPath completed
fame Norg 224
trigger Mamaulabion                     # fame level 3: 93
finish
fame Norg 225
trade Mamaulabion EgilsTorch x1         # available: nothing
trigger Mamaulabion                     # 191
finish                                  # begun
trigger Mamaulabion                     # none given: 192
finish
trade Mamaulabion BottleOfBubblyWater x1   # bit 0 set; 193 (1202)
finish                                  # confirmed: taken
trade Mamaulabion BottleOfBubblyWater x1   # already given: 194 (1202)
finish                                  # no finish: kept
trade Mamaulabion EgilsTorch x1 EyeOfNept x1   # two items: nothing
trade Mamaulabion EgilsTorch x1         # 193
finish
trade Mamaulabion EyeOfNept x1          # 193
finish
